['turkiye-pide','Pide (Turkish Boat-Shaped Cheese and Beef Flatbread)','Turkey','🇹🇷',45,['bread flour','water','dry yeast','ground beef','white cheese','tomato','green pepper'],[[120,'g'],[70,'ml'],[2,'g'],[80,'g'],[45,'g'],[60,'g'],[35,'g']],'https://goturkiye.com/gastronomy/blog/16-foods-you-have-to-try-on-your-trip-to-turkiye',['Mix flour, yeast, water, and a pinch of salt into a soft dough; cover until doubled.','Brown the beef lightly, cool, and combine with chopped tomato and green pepper.','Stretch the dough into a long oval, spread the filling, add cheese, and fold up the edges into a boat.','Bake at 230°C until the crust is browned and the beef is safely cooked; slice and serve hot.']],
['turkiye-gozleme','Gözleme (Turkish Spinach and Cheese Griddle Bread)','Turkey','🇹🇷',35,['bread flour','water','spinach','white cheese','onion','olive oil','salt'],[[110,'g'],[60,'ml'],[100,'g'],[60,'g'],[40,'g'],[1,'tsp'],[1,'g']],'https://goturkiye.com/gastronomy/blog/16-foods-you-have-to-try-on-your-trip-to-turkiye',['Knead flour, water, and salt into a smooth dough and rest it for twenty minutes.','Soften onion in half the oil, wilt the spinach, cool, and mix with crumbled cheese.','Roll the dough paper-thin, spread filling over one half, fold, and seal the edges.','Cook on a hot dry griddle until spotted and crisp on both sides, then brush lightly with oil.']],
['turkiye-kuru-fasulye','Kuru Fasulye (Turkish White Bean and Tomato Stew)','Turkey','🇹🇷',75,['white beans','onion','tomato paste','tomato','olive oil','sweet paprika','water'],[[110,'g'],[70,'g'],[1,'tbsp'],[100,'g'],[1,'tbsp'],[0.5,'tsp'],[450,'ml']],'https://goturkiye.com/blog/16-foods-you-have-to-try-on-your-trip-to-turkiye',['Soak the beans overnight, drain, cover with fresh water, and simmer until nearly tender.','Soften onion in olive oil, then cook the tomato paste and paprika until fragrant.','Add chopped tomato, beans, and measured water and bring to a gentle simmer.','Cook until the beans are creamy but intact and the sauce is thick; season and rest before serving.']],
['turkiye-iskender-kebab','İskender Kebab (Bursa Beef, Bread, Tomato, and Yogurt Plate)','Turkey','🇹🇷',40,['beef sirloin','flatbread','tomato puree','yogurt','butter','green pepper','salt'],[[170,'g'],[90,'g'],[100,'g'],[80,'g'],[15,'g'],[40,'g'],[1,'g']],'https://goturkiye.com/gastronomy/marmara',['Chill the beef briefly for easy slicing, then cut it into very thin strips.','Toast bite-size flatbread pieces and arrange them on a warm serving plate.','Sear the beef and pepper over high heat until browned and safely cooked; warm the tomato puree separately.','Spoon tomato sauce over bread, add beef and yogurt, and finish with hot melted butter.']],
['turkiye-adana-kebab','Adana Kebab (Spicy Minced Lamb Skewer)','Turkey','🇹🇷',35,['ground lamb','lamb tail fat','red pepper flakes','sweet paprika','salt','flatbread','onion'],[[170,'g'],[25,'g'],[1,'tsp'],[0.5,'tsp'],[1.5,'g'],[80,'g'],[50,'g']],'https://goturkiye.com/adana/taste',['Knead lamb, finely chopped tail fat, pepper flakes, paprika, and salt until cohesive; chill briefly.','Press the mixture evenly around a wide metal skewer with damp hands.','Grill over strong heat, turning often, until browned and safely cooked through.','Warm the flatbread under the skewer drippings and serve with sliced onion.']],
['turkiye-icli-kofte','İçli Köfte (Adana Bulgur Shell with Spiced Beef)','Turkey','🇹🇷',55,['fine bulgur','semolina','ground beef','onion','walnut','red pepper flakes','olive oil'],[[85,'g'],[20,'g'],[100,'g'],[60,'g'],[20,'g'],[0.5,'tsp'],[1,'tbsp']],'https://goturkiye.com/adana/taste',['Cover bulgur and semolina with 100 ml hot water, rest, then knead into a pliable shell mixture.','Brown beef and onion, season with pepper flakes, stir in chopped walnut, and cool completely.','Shape a thin bulgur cup around a finger, add filling, and pinch closed into a pointed oval.','Poach gently until the dumpling rises and the centre is safely cooked, then drain and serve warm.']],
['turkiye-kunefe','Künefe (Hatay Cheese-Filled Shredded Pastry)','Turkey','🇹🇷',35,['shredded filo','unsalted melting cheese','butter','sugar','water','pistachio','lemon'],[[120,'g'],[90,'g'],[25,'g'],[70,'g'],[70,'ml'],[12,'g'],[0.125,'piece']],'https://goturkiye.com/hatay/taste',['Boil sugar, water, and lemon briefly into a light syrup, then cool it.','Rub shredded filo thoroughly with melted butter and press half into a small pan.','Spread the unsalted cheese evenly, cover with remaining pastry, and press firmly.','Cook until crisp and golden on both sides, pour over cool syrup, and top with pistachio.']],
['turkiye-firin-sutlac','Fırın Sütlaç (Turkish Baked Rice Pudding)','Turkey','🇹🇷',55,['milk','rice','sugar','rice flour','water','vanilla','cinnamon'],[[300,'ml'],[35,'g'],[40,'g'],[10,'g'],[100,'ml'],[0.5,'tsp'],[0.25,'tsp']],'https://goturkiye.com/gastronomy/blog/10-turkish-desserts-you-need-to-try',['Simmer the rice in water until very tender and most water has been absorbed.','Add milk and sugar and simmer gently; whisk rice flour with a little cold milk and stir it in.','Cook until lightly thickened, add vanilla, and divide into a heatproof dish.','Bake under strong top heat until the surface develops dark spots; cool and dust with cinnamon.']],
['turkiye-asure','Aşure (Turkish Wheat, Bean, Fruit, and Nut Pudding)','Turkey','🇹🇷',90,['wheat berries','chickpeas','white beans','dried apricot','raisins','sugar','walnut','water'],[[70,'g'],[35,'g'],[35,'g'],[30,'g'],[25,'g'],[45,'g'],[15,'g'],[600,'ml']],'https://goturkiye.com/gastronomy/blog/10-turkish-desserts-you-need-to-try',['Soak wheat, chickpeas, and beans separately overnight; drain and cook each until tender.','Combine them with measured water and simmer until the wheat releases starch and thickens the liquid.','Add chopped apricot, raisins, and sugar and cook gently until the fruit softens.','Spoon into bowls, cool to a soft pudding consistency, and garnish with chopped walnut.']],
['turkiye-simit','Simit (Turkish Sesame Ring Bread)','Turkey','🇹🇷',50,['bread flour','water','dry yeast','grape molasses','sesame seeds','olive oil','salt'],[[125,'g'],[70,'ml'],[2,'g'],[1,'tbsp'],[35,'g'],[1,'tsp'],[1.5,'g']],'https://gastronomy.goturkiye.com/turkish-cuisine',['Knead flour, yeast, water, olive oil, and salt until elastic; cover until slightly risen.','Divide the dough into two ropes, twist them together, and join the ends into a ring.','Dilute grape molasses with one tablespoon water, dip the ring, then coat generously with sesame.','Bake at 220°C until deeply browned, crisp outside, and fully baked within.']]
